# Top-Up + Auto-Top-Up Sheet

::summary
ONE sheet for manual top-up AND the auto-top-up toggle (RULED 08-05), opened from the Credits meter's Top up credits: pack rows route to the payment processor checkout; below the separator, the Auto top-up toggle (toggled attr) with its threshold + pack selects; then Redeem a code. Footer: card on file ends in 4242; receipts land in billing history.
::

::modal[name=top-up title="Top up credits" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::row[icon=sparkle action=buyCreditPack href=#]
Small · $10
1M credits
:::

:::row[icon=sparkle action=buyCreditPack href=#]
Medium · $45
5M credits · 10% bonus
:::

:::row[icon=sparkle action=buyCreditPack href=#]
Large · $96
12M credits · 20% bonus
:::

:::row[icon=task action=toggleAutoTopUp href=# trailing-label="On" trailing-action=toggleAutoTopUp]
Auto top-up — ON
When below 500K, buy a Medium pack
:::

:::toolbar
- dropdown[label="Threshold: 500K" options=500k|1m|2m action=setAutoTopUpThreshold]
- dropdown[label="Pack: Medium" options=small|medium|large action=setAutoTopUpPack]
:::

:::form[name=redeem submit="Redeem" action=redeemCode]
- Code (text, "Redeem a code") *
:::

Card on file ends in 4242. Receipts land in billing history.

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Pack rows go straight to the payment processor checkout; the auto-top-up selects stay inert while the toggle is off.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) this tall sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets (auto width), drops to 58px under the top bar, and caps at calc(100vh − 140px) — the body scrolls inside the cap; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
